Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 21:41:20 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 30/57] cachefile: the content of a remote rule-set in a file
 of its own

The cache file keeps the content of each remote rule-set in a file of its own; lists of an earlier
version are moved and the database compacted.

Made of these commits of the earlier series (branch archive/r25-1.14-commits):
  384b5173c cachefile: the content of a remote rule set in a file of its own
  834727551 cachefile: lists of an earlier version moved into files, the file compacted
  4db012f5d cachefile: the compaction takes the database the move of the lists left

Pdk-Feature: cachefile-files
Pdk-Zone: core
Pdk-Layer: 03
---
